{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee 925</strong> is a short existential horror game about work, meritocracy, and performance evaluation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you arrive at your desk.<br>Every day, you do the job.<br>Every day, you go <strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</strong>.<br>And then\u2026 you come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a cycle \u2014 a workday with no clear end.<br>Your tasks are vague, your workplace endless, and your role unquestionable.<br>Your name: forgotten.<br>Your identity: disposable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A loop without exit</strong> \u2014 The day always starts the same, and plays out the same. Please comply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun mandatory training</strong> \u2014 Let us improve together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morse as language</strong> \u2014 Words are dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling familiarity</strong> \u2014 A world in shades of purple and green, where routine is the true horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in. Work. Clock out. Repeat. Comply. Comply. Comply.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Steam Deck.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Employee Of The Month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948890/1360a20a760ae97969defa477c757c74d5f961fc.jpg"},{"name":"Disengaged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948890/4bc1559bedc6577ad65f5408e205d66f9bb1bedd.jpg"},{"name":"Terminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948890/7a1a7a259c6c9c7f9cf09686f6daa01134b219a7.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/